{"slug":"WarCommand-Make-your-units-intelligent-with-custom-paths-238168","_id":"6a36b111c775c9d2ea014ef7","title":"Make your units intelligent with custom paths","game":{"_id":"6893d4f9c23f749e7052f89b","gameId":12912934221,"name":"WarCommand","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":12912934221},"features":"Tired of the game's crappy unit movement system? Why not make them more intelligent using this!\n\n[ HOW TO USE ]\nCreate a path by placing nodes which the units will follow. The order of placement will be the order in which units follow first (Just look at labels above)\n\n[ FEATURES ]\n-> Can create up to four paths (Units will go to the nearest first node)\n-> Delete the current path selected (Do note that units following that path will just stop)\n-> Move all Units (Make all units follow the nearest path)\n-> Auto March (All units that are spawned will follow the nearest path)\n-> Destroy all paths (Do note that units following the paths will just stop)\n-> The spreading of the units (How much you want to spread your units out, smaller number means they are closer together)\n-> Auto-shoot where they will destroy anything blocking their way","tags":[],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ThetrulyAnonymous/ScriptsCollection/refs/heads/main/PathCreator.lua\"))()","owner":{"_id":"69d3c376e52e8dc73f4ccc9b","username":"Theultimateuser","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"status":"offline","id":"69d3c376e52e8dc73f4ccc9b","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":10000},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"verified":false,"views":288,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/68079ef575fd65a56fea69cd0578598d0f743809e704099bd416a4